A||||9||fierodave||Another Fiero GT getting it's resto||||6||
Z||000000||fierodave||08-31-2001||03:32 AM||||<BR>Another Fiero I got from Ca last winter is getting it's resto done!   It's an 88 Med Met Red GT 5-speed with 60k original miles  This album should be updated daily.  This one gets a complete Base clear paint job,  with New:  Windshield, Sail windows,  dew wipes,  Moldings,  and some other NOS Stuff I was saving  <BR>A big hats off to Bill Bailey in Deland FL.  He supplied the 88 seats I needed for this project. They are perfect Bill~ Thank you!<P>This one may take about 4 weeks to complete!  I have to wait until the dealer has the recall parts in for it and they can keep the car for a few days if need be!  Photos below:<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=101570&a=13695445" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=101570&a=13695445</A> <P>Thanks for the space, <BR>FD||||reg||6
Z||000001||My7Fieros||08-31-2001||03:45 AM||||Cool Dave! Glad to see you restoring another one! I like it when you restore/save them  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">...I dont when you part them  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> (but yes I know sometimes it has to be done). Be sure to post pics when she's finished!<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="red"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||14
