Z||000009||fierodave||09-03-2001||02:10 PM||||The 88 has all the body damage on the panels & stone nicks repaired, it is all Sanded,wet sanded, washed down ready for primer & sealer.<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=101570&a=13695445" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=101570&a=13695445</A> <P>I was going through the parts removed from the car and I need a GT front bumper cover emblem in good condition for the car  let me know if you have one!<BR>FD||||reg||1
